{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"十有二年春，薛伯定卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"夏，葬薛襄公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"叔孫州仇帥師墮郈。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"衛公孟彄帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"季孫斯、仲孫何忌帥師墮費。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"冬十月癸亥，公會齊侯盟于黃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"十有一月丙寅朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"公至自黃。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"十有二月，公圍成。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"公至自圍成。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"十二年夏，衛公孟彄伐曹，克郊。還，滑羅殿。未出，不退於列。其御曰：「殿而在列，其為無勇乎？」羅曰：「與其素厲，寧為無勇。」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"仲由為季氏宰，將墮三都，於是叔孫氏墮郈。季氏將墮費，公山不狃、叔孫輒帥費人以襲魯。公與三子入于季氏之宮，登武子之臺。費人攻之，弗克。入及公側，仲尼命申句須、樂頎下，伐之，費人北。國人追之，敗諸姑蔑。二子奔齊，遂墮費。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"將墮成，公斂處父謂孟孫：「墮成，齊人必至于北門。且成，孟氏之保障也。無成，是無孟氏也。子偽不知，我將不墜。」","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_225_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_225","textTraditional":"冬十二月，公圍成，弗克。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}